Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-6C\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-67\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"1446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2253\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"3309\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Everything we did with logarithms, we can do with the common logarithm. For example, we can</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>convert between exponential and logarithm form,</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>evaluate common logarithm expressions, and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>calculate specific values of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.589ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1975.7 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\\log a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-6C\" d=\"M42 46H56Q95 46 103 60V68Q103 77 103 91T103 124T104 167T104 217T104 272T104 329Q104 366 104 407T104 482T104 542T103 586T103 603Q100 622 89 628T44 637H26V660Q26 683 28 683L38 684Q48 685 67 686T104 688Q121 689 141 690T171 693T182 694H185V379Q185 62 186 60Q190 52 198 49Q219 46 247 46H263V0H255L232 1Q209 2 183 2T145 3T107 3T57 1L34 0H26V46H42Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-6F\" d=\"M28 214Q28 309 93 378T250 448Q340 448 405 380T471 215Q471 120 407 55T250 -10Q153 -10 91 57T28 214ZM250 30Q372 30 372 193V2